                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Yosuwa mwene Nuni yari yuzuye impwemu y’ubgenge, kuko Mose yari yaramurambitsekw ibiganza. Nukw Abisirayeli baramwumvira, bagenza nk’uk’ Uhoraho yari yarabariye Mose.",
          "type": "text",
