          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no kubg’ ivy’ ububasha n’ibiteye ubgoba vyose Mose yakoreye imbere y’ Abisirayeli bose.",
          "type": "text",
